  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Sales Management and Service Quality"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "This interdisciplinary Minor enables students to understand the fundamentals of the sales process, as well as the quantitative and qualitative tools necessary to manage customer relationships and ensure that expectations are met. Students increase their knowledge of the new media tools that dominate sales communication today and are given the opportunity to develop the leadership and management skills that are an integral part of any successful sales team."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: Ted Rogers School of Business Management, Marketing Department"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Required course (1) should be taken first :"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MKT 504 Effective Persuasion",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MKT 504",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/marketing/MKT/504/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus five (5) of the following:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "CMN 288 Communication and Social Media",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "CMN 288",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/communication/CMN/288/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "HTM 704 Advanced Professional Selling",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "HTM 704",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/hospitality-and-tourism-management/HTM/704/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "HTT 100 Tourism Experiences Management",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "HTT 100",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/hospitality-and-tourism-management/HTT/100/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "HTT 605 Incentive Marketing",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "HTT 605",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/hospitality-and-tourism-management/HTT/605/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "MHR 523 Human Resources Management or HTH 503 Human Resources Management",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "MHR 523",
